Track 2: Is the pressure steady?
- Story & Context: During a routine check of the reactor core, Elara discovers a hidden archive of 1950s love songs playing through the maintenance vents of the Hydroponics Bay 7. She begins to transcribe the melodies into the ship's navigation computer, realizing the music matches the heart rate of a panicked child hiding in the vents. She asks the room to respond, her voice barely a breath: "How long can we boil before we forget our own names?"
